sequenceDiagram
    participant M as IT Manager
    participant O as submit_slurm.py
    participant S as SLURM Scheduler
    participant W as WhisperX (GPU)
    participant L as Ollama / DeepSeek-R1 32B (GPU)
    participant F as Filesystem

    M->>F: Upload call recordings to audio_data/[Agent]/
    M->>O: ./run_speaker_analysis.sh audio_data
    O->>S: Submit one transcription + analysis job per agent
    S->>W: Run transcription job
    W->>W: Transcribe + diarize each call (large-v2 + pyannote)
    W->>F: Write [CallID].vtt (speaker-labeled)
    S->>L: Run analysis job
    L->>F: Read .vtt transcripts
    L->>L: Score each call against 100-pt rubric, structured JSON
    L->>F: Write analysis_results.json + analysis_report.md
    L->>F: Route call to needs_further_attention/ or reviewed/
    M->>F: Open needs_further_attention/ and analysis_report.md
